    "title": "AI Anime",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc9fAI Anime generates the anime image.\r\n\ud83d\udc97Just enter the prompts and AI Anime will bring you the best anime picture.\r\n\r\n\u3010How to use AI Beauty\u3011\r\n\u2705 Select a style from the photo list.\r\n\u2705 Enter the your requirement in the prompt space.\r\n\u2705 Click the \"GENERATE\" button.\r\n\u2705 You can take pictures of beautiful women.\r\n       There is also a \"Save\" button.\r\n\r\nLet's create your beautiful woman with our AI beauty app.\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\n\u3010Technology of this app\u3011\r\nThis app uses Stable Diffusion technology.\r\nStable Diffusion is a potential text-to-image diffusion model capable of generating photorealistic images given any text input, cultivating the autonomous freedom to create stunning images and empowering billions of people to create stunning art in seconds. let it be",
